  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MEAL - Burkina Faso 2021-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The MEAL-team (MEAL expert + communications expert) supports the Embassy in implementing and operating a MEAL system covering the 2021-2025 Burkina Faso bilateral programme and capable of producing and valorizing reliable and sufficient data for the needs of program management, accountability and communication of results to interested audiences - taking into account the volatile and difficult security situation as well as the requirements of the DDD approach in terms of adaptability and learning.</narrative>
  </description>
